 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Start by looking at the size of the place. Is it busy, or could you go somewhere quiet? Then look at the reviews. Do they mention using lot of oil, and did they like the tough cut of meat? It is. Also, watch out for places that use the term beef when they really mean beef and lamb dishes. Not necessarily. Many restaurants really do have special cuts that they keep fresh. If you see something you' never seen before, it' worth trying. On Monday, some shops restock from suppliers, and the fresh stuff is cheap.",
